aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.VARIANT.title = Variant of
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.VARIANT.hint = Pick which main building type this variant counts as.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.SUBSTEP.title = Important spots
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.SUBSTEP.hint = Placement blocks are added to your inventory for each substep. Place or click the required blocks and spots inside the footprint.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.MATERIALS.title = Build materials
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.MATERIALS.hint = Press F to open the build materials menu. Prefab fill adds costs without giving you items.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.MATERIALS.detail = Use plus and minus to change counts. Add from inventory copies counts into the list and returns your items.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.title = Building settings
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.hint = Set treasury gold cost, self build days, style, prefab empty spaces, plot token lock, assembly sections, and optionally submit to the community marketplace.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.detail = Gold is paid from the town treasury when the plot is built. Self build days is how long the plot takes to finish without a building staff. Style groups your building in the plot crafting bench. Save empty spaces controls whether air in your footprint is saved to clear blocks when built. Plot token locked requires players to unlock this plot at the plot crafting bench before they can craft tokens. Assembly sections splits the build into an N×N×N grid (1 = off).

aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.selfBuildDays = Self-build days (game days)

aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.saveEmptySpaces = Save empty spaces in prefab
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.saveEmptySpaces.hint = When on, air in your footprint is saved and clears those blocks when the building is assembled. When off, only solid blocks are saved and existing terrain is kept. Editor empty markers always clear blocks.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.touristDestination = Visitors may stop here
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.touristDestination.hint = When on, portal visitors may walk to this building during the day.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.plotTokenLocked = Plot token locked by default
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.plotTokenLocked.hint = When on, players must unlock this plot at the plot crafting bench (using a plot blueprint) before they can craft plot tokens for it.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.floatingGiftBlueprint = Balloon plot blueprint
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.floatingGiftBlueprint.hint = When on, regular (white) balloon gifts can drop a plot blueprint for this building. Requires plot token locked.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.assemblySections = Assembly sections per axis (1–16)
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.styleId = Style
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.styleId.hint = Any name you like

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.REVIEW.title = Review
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.REVIEW.hint = Save the building. You will get a plot token to place it in town.

